{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《World Flags and Geography》是一款結合遊戲與學習的工具，透過測驗考驗你對世界國旗、地理位置及國家首都的認識，適合地理老師與學生使用。目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-224.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>邊玩邊學國旗地理與首都</h2>\n<p>這款 App 同時具備遊戲與學習功能，透過內建測驗，讓使用者認識世界各國國旗的外觀、國家所在的地理位置，以及各自首都的名稱。作答過程不再只是背誦，而是以遊戲方式反覆練習，適合地理老師在課堂輔助教學，也適合學生課後自我測試。透過一次次挑戰，逐步累積國旗、地理與首都知識。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-308-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-178-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-310-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-179-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-312-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-180-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：World Flags and Geography</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/world-flags-and-geography/id721350453?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T21:44:20.358649+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T21:24:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T22:17:51.132056+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T21:37:49.168416+00:00","content_hash":"317f1268558cc454f6694ff805158bc37e61e758ac3d818dd204276b601b6161","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}